  "disposition": "EXACT_ARCHIVE_ONLY_WHOLE_PRESENTATION_POLICY_METADATA_OR_EFFECTFUL_ENTRYPOINT",
  "review_notes": [
    "All2013 original and3613 organized bytes were individually read, including two whole records, one actual defect predicate and four complete theorem proof terms.",
    "FormalLatexProjection stores an actual LeanDeclarationProjection -> LatexFragment function, a notationSpec and three independent Bool flags. Each of its three theorems is the exact identity implication from an explicit h equating one flag to true; no renderer is implemented or verified and none of the flags is tied to renderDeclaration.",
    "RendererQAReport stores reportPath:String, six Nat counters and paperModePass:Bool. hasBlockingDefects is an actual disjunction of six nonzero-counter tests or paperModePass=false; its exact formula is acknowledged, not reduced to an arbitrary chosen Prop.",
    "renderer_qa_fails_paper_mode_on_blocking_defects has the genuine conclusion R.paperModePass=false OR R.paperModePass=true. Its proof is Or.symm (Bool.eq_false_or_eq_true R.paperModePass), ignores _h and does not prove paperModePass=false from defects. No stronger failure/QA result is inferred from its name.",
    "The complete renderer/QA artifact schemas, the real predicate and exact conditional proofs stay archived under Math AGENTS. Full relevant declaration, fragment and notation providers were read; root LeanProjection/ReferenceGraph imports remain historically unresolved instead of binding by basename."
  ],
